# PrepForge — Documentation

This directory will contain project documentation as the project matures.

Planned documentation:

- `architecture.md` — detailed architecture decisions and diagrams
- `api.md` — REST API reference
- `setup.md` — detailed local development setup guide
- `contributing.md` — contribution guidelines (if applicable)
- `data-model.md` — MongoDB collection and schema documentation
- `security.md` — security design decisions

Documentation will be added incrementally alongside each development phase.
